<title>BELGIUM: Generale Bank eyes US fund manager -paper.</title>
<headline>Generale Bank eyes US fund manager -paper.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium's biggest bank Generale Bank will announce on Wednesday the purchase of a U.S. fund manager, Belgian newspaper L'Echo reported on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Generale Bank has called a news conference for Wednesday but has declined to state the subject of the presentation.</p>
<p>L'Echo said the fund manager was Boston-based, but did not name the target company.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6817, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
